    "detailed_description": "<h1>Roteiro 2025\u20132026</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531260/extras/b041e711466a73fd938376312e765bbc.avif?t=1754987684\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to protect your city? In <strong>Superhero Simulator</strong>, take on the rising crime rate as you patrol the streets, stop robberies, rescue civilians, and battle powerful villains. <strong>Your choices shape the city!</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531260/extras/a1a8dc9e63c199925da81d665a6f9732.poster.avif?t=1754987684\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531260/extras/a1a8dc9e63c199925da81d665a6f9732.webm?t=1754987684\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531260/extras/a1a8dc9e63c199925da81d665a6f9732.mp4?t=1754987684\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SAVE THE CITY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stop robberies, rescue civilians, and fight crime your way. Every heroic act unlocks new abilities - become the hero <strong>Goldpine</strong> needs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531260/extras/ca43c9ae022bfef84b4019abf91ad0a9.poster.avif?t=1754987684\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531260/extras/ca43c9ae022bfef84b4019abf91ad0a9.webm?t=1754987684\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531260/extras/ca43c9ae022bfef84b4019abf91ad0a9.mp4?t=1754987684\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MANAGE YOUR DAILY NEEDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Being a hero doesn\u2019t pay the bills\u2014so you\u2019ll <strong>need a job to survive. Drive a taxi, flip burgers, or find other ways</strong> to <strong>earn money</strong>  Every <strong>&quot;Gollar&quot;</strong> counts, whether it\u2019s for food, or upgrading your gear. <strong>Balance your heroic duties with everyday struggles.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531260/extras/a7319831266b5a1c4777c52d84308c3b.poster.avif?t=1754987684\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531260/extras/a7319831266b5a1c4777c52d84308c3b.webm?t=1754987684\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531260/extras/a7319831266b5a1c4777c52d84308c3b.mp4?t=1754987684\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CUSTOMIZE YOUR HERO</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your perfect superhero AND civilian identity! Mix and match masks, capes, and armor sets to create your signature look. Your hero, your style, your legend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531260/extras/7e4d2ce39fd02b38c9f39b3c148e9383.poster.avif?t=1754987684\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531260/extras/7e4d2ce39fd02b38c9f39b3c148e9383.webm?t=1754987684\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531260/extras/7e4d2ce39fd02b38c9f39b3c148e9383.mp4?t=1754987684\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RISE OR FALL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your <strong>health, hygiene, mental state, and respect</strong> to stay at your best. Neglect them, and your journey becomes harder. Every action shapes your legend\u2014will you rise or break under the pressure?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531260/extras/62d6dafdcdc2ceddc7dc3fd5abcb29ae.poster.avif?t=1754987684\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531260/extras/62d6dafdcdc2ceddc7dc3fd5abcb29ae.webm?t=1754987684\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531260/extras/62d6dafdcdc2ceddc7dc3fd5abcb29ae.mp4?t=1754987684\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to protect your city? In <strong>Superhero Simulator</strong>, take on the rising crime rate as you patrol the streets, stop robberies, rescue civilians, and battle powerful villains. <strong>Your choices shape the city!</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531260/extras/a1a8dc9e63c199925da81d665a6f9732.poster.avif?t=1754987684\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531260/extras/a1a8dc9e63c199925da81d665a6f9732.webm?t=1754987684\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531260/extras/a1a8dc9e63c199925da81d665a6f9732.mp4?t=1754987684\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SAVE THE CITY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stop robberies, rescue civilians, and fight crime your way. Every heroic act unlocks new abilities - become the hero <strong>Goldpine</strong> needs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531260/extras/ca43c9ae022bfef84b4019abf91ad0a9.poster.avif?t=1754987684\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531260/extras/ca43c9ae022bfef84b4019abf91ad0a9.webm?t=1754987684\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531260/extras/ca43c9ae022bfef84b4019abf91ad0a9.mp4?t=1754987684\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MANAGE YOUR DAILY NEEDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Being a hero doesn\u2019t pay the bills\u2014so you\u2019ll <strong>need a job to survive. Drive a taxi, flip burgers, or find other ways</strong> to <strong>earn money</strong>  Every <strong>&quot;Gollar&quot;</strong> counts, whether it\u2019s for food, or upgrading your gear. <strong>Balance your heroic duties with everyday struggles.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531260/extras/a7319831266b5a1c4777c52d84308c3b.poster.avif?t=1754987684\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531260/extras/a7319831266b5a1c4777c52d84308c3b.webm?t=1754987684\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531260/extras/a7319831266b5a1c4777c52d84308c3b.mp4?t=1754987684\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CUSTOMIZE YOUR HERO</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your perfect superhero AND civilian identity! Mix and match masks, capes, and armor sets to create your signature look. Your hero, your style, your legend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531260/extras/7e4d2ce39fd02b38c9f39b3c148e9383.poster.avif?t=1754987684\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531260/extras/7e4d2ce39fd02b38c9f39b3c148e9383.webm?t=1754987684\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531260/extras/7e4d2ce39fd02b38c9f39b3c148e9383.mp4?t=1754987684\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RISE OR FALL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your <strong>health, hygiene, mental state, and respect</strong> to stay at your best. Neglect them, and your journey becomes harder. Every action shapes your legend\u2014will you rise or break under the pressure?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531260/extras/62d6dafdcdc2ceddc7dc3fd5abcb29ae.poster.avif?t=1754987684\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531260/extras/62d6dafdcdc2ceddc7dc3fd5abcb29ae.webm?t=1754987684\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531260/extras/62d6dafdcdc2ceddc7dc3fd5abcb29ae.mp4?t=1754987684\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>",
